---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'; import weekly from '../../data/weekly.json';
---
<Layout title="本周观察"><div class="wrap page"><div class="page-intro"><div class="kicker">THE WEEKLY SIGNAL / 02</div><h1>本周观察<span class="accent">.</span></h1><p>追踪本站观察池中的开源项目，发现值得关注的新变化。</p></div>{weekly.length ? <div class="weekly-list">{weekly.map(issue=><section class="detail-section"><div class="kicker">APPROVED / {issue.week}</div><h2>{issue.week} · 七日涨星观察</h2><p>快照区间：{issue.start} 至 {issue.end}；审核人：{issue.reviewed_by}。</p><div class="ranking">{issue.projects.map((p,i)=><a class="ranking-row" href={`/p/${p.id}/`}><span class="accent">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><strong>{p.full_name}</strong><span>+{p.delta7} ★ / 7 天</span><span>当前 {Number(p.stars).toLocaleString()} ★ ↗</span></a>)}</div></section>)}</div> : <div class="weekly-empty weekly-page"><div><span class="live-dot"></span><span class="mono">COLLECTING SIGNALS</span><h2>第一期榜单正在准备</h2><p>我们需要持续积累实际星标快照，才能计算七日净增长。榜单审核通过后将在这里展示。</p><a class="outline-btn" href="/search/">先去探索工具 ↗</a></div><span class="weekly-number">01<span> / WEEKLY</span></span></div>}<section class="detail-section rules"><div class="kicker">HOW IT WORKS</div><h2>关于这份榜单</h2><div class="rule-grid"><div><b>01 / 观察范围</b><p>仅覆盖本站已发现并持续观察的项目，并非 GitHub 全站排名。</p></div><div><b>02 / 真实数据</b><p>基于可比较的实际快照计算增长。数据不足时不展示七日涨幅。</p></div><div><b>03 / 人工审核</b><p>榜单和推荐需经过审核；无法确认的信息不会作肯定判断。</p></div></div></section></div></Layout>
